line 8), omit \"2023\", substitute \"2024\".* > > *(4) Page 63 (after line 17), at the end of the Bill, add:* > >> *Schedule 3 — Consultation* >> >> *1 Consultation* >> >> *(1) Before 1 July 2024, the Treasurer must ensure that:* >> >>> *(a) consultation on the amendments made by Schedule 2 to this Act is undertaken:* >>> >>>> *(i) for a period of at least 3 months; and* >>>> >>>> *(ii) with such industry participants as the Treasurer considers appropriate; and* >>> >>> *(b) a report is prepared on the consultation.* >> >> *(2) As soon as practicable after the completion of the report referred to in paragraph (1)(b), the persons who prepared the report must give it to the Treasurer.* >> >> *(3) The Treasurer must cause a copy of the report to be tabled in each House of the Parliament within 15 sitting days of that House after the report is given to the Treasurer.*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-8855","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2024-03-27/19"}
